hadiths[51]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1055","Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Man ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham bin Sad ne mujh se bayan kiya, Nafi se, ke Abdullah bin Umar ne farmaya: Jab ghair maskoon ghar me dakhil ho to kahe: Assalamu alaina wa ala ibadillahis saliheen."
"1056","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin al-Husain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yazid al-Nahwi se, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Apne gharon ke siwa aur gharon me dakhil na ho yahan tak ke ijazat talab karo aur un ke rehne walon ko salam karo, aur us se istisna kiya, phir farmaya: Tum par koi harj nahin ke tum aise gharon me dakhil ho jo abad na hon jin me tumhara saman ho aur Allah janta hai jo tum zahir karte ho aur jo tum chhupate ho."
"1057","Usman bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin al-Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, Shaiban se, Laith se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se: Liyastazinkumullazina malakat aimanukum, unhon ne kaha: Ye mardon ke liye hai aurton ke liye nahin."
"1058","Matar bin al-Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham al-Dastuwai se, Yahya bin Abi Kathir se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke jab un ki aulad me se koi bacha baloghat ko pahunchta to usay alag kar dete, phir us ke paas ijazat ke baghair dakhil na hote."
"1059","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amash se, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Abdullah ke paas aaya, us ne kaha: Kya main apni walida ke paas aane ki ijazat talab karun, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum unhen un ki har haalat me dekhna pasand karoge."
"1060","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muslim bin Nazir ko kehte hue suna: Ek shakhs ne Huzaifa se sawal kiya, phir kaha: Kya main apni walida ke paas aane ki ijazat talab karun, to unhon ne kaha: Agar tum us se ijazat talab na karoge to aisi cheez dekhoge jo tum napasand karte ho."
"1061","Farwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Laith se, Ubaidullah se, Musa bin Talha se, unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke sath apni walida ke paas gaya, phir wo andar dakhil hue to main un ke peeche gaya, phir unhon ne mur kar dekha to mere seene me dhakka diya yahan tak ke mujhe meri sareen par bitha diya, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum baghair ijazat ke andar aate ho."
"1062","Ismail bin Aban ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Mushir ne hum se bayan kiya, Ashas se, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi apne bete aur apni walida se ijazat talab kare agarche wo zaeefa ho aur apne bhai aur apni behan aur apne walid se."
"1063","Al-Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr aur Ibn Juraij ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se sawal kiya, phir kaha: Kya main apni behan ke paas aane ki ijazat talab karun, to unhon ne kaha: Han, phir main ne dohra kar kaha: Do behnen meri parwarish me hain aur main un ke kharch ka zimmedar hun aur un par kharch karta hun, kya main un dono se ijazat talab karun, unhon ne kaha: Han, kya tum pasand karoge ke tum un dono ko nangay dekho, phir unhon ne ye aayat parhi: Aye iman walon tum se ijazat talab karein wo jin ke malik tumhare dahine hath hue se lekar teen parda ke auqat tumhare liye tak, unhon ne kaha: In logon ko ijazat ka hukm sirf in teen parda wale auqat me diya gaya, unhon ne kaha: Aur jab tum me se bache baloghat ko pahunch jayen to wo ijazat talab karein jaise un se pehle logon ne ijazat talab ki."
"1064","Qutaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abthar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ashas se, Kardus se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi apne walid aur apni walida aur apne bhai aur apni behan se ijazat talab kare."
"1065","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makhlad ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujhe khabar di, Ubaid bin Umair se, ke Abu Musa Ashari ne Umar bin Khattab se andar aane ki ijazat chahi, to unhen ijazat na di gayi aur goya wo masroof the, phir Abu Musa wapas chale gaye, phir Umar farigh hue to kaha: Kya main ne Abdullah bin Qais ki aawaz nahin suni thi, unhen ijazat do, kaha gaya: Wo wapas ja chuke hain, phir unhon ne unhen bulaya, to unhon ne kaha: Hamen isi ka hukm diya jata tha, to unhon ne kaha: Tum is par mere paas daleel lao, phir wo Ansar ki majlis ki taraf gaye aur un se pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Is par tumhare liye ham me se sab se chhote Abu Said Khudri ke siwa koi gawahi nahin dega, phir wo Abu Said ko sath le gaye, to Umar ne kaha: Kya mujh se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka hukm poshida reh gaya, mujhe bazaaron me len den ne ghaafil kar diya yani tijarat ke liye nikalne ne."
"1066","Bayan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik bin Abi Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, Abu Huraira se, us shakhs ke bare me jo salam se pehle ijazat talab kare, unhon ne kaha: Usay ijazat na di jayegi yahan tak ke wo salam se ibtida kare."
"1067","Ibrahim bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne humein khabar di, ke Ibn Juraij ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ata ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Jab koi dakhil ho aur Assalamu alaikum na kahe to kaho: Nahin, yahan tak ke wo chaabi lekar aaye jo salam hai."
"1068","Abul Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zinad ne hum se bayan kiya, Araj se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Agar koi shakhs tumhare ghar mein jhaanke phir tum use kankari maro aur uski aankh phod do to tum par koi gunah nahin."
"1069","Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ishaq bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam khare namaz parh rahe thay ke ek shakhs ne Aap ke ghar mein jhaanka to Aap ne apne tarqash se ek teer liya phir use uski aankhon ki taraf seedha kiya."
"1070","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Shihab ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke Sahl bin Saad ne unhein khabar di, ke ek shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke darwaze ke surakh se jhaanka aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas ek kangha tha jis se Aap apna sar khujla rahe thay, phir jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne use dekha to farmaya: Agar mujhe maloom hota ke tum mera intezar kar rahe ho to main ise tumhari aankh mein chubho deta."
"1071","Aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ijazat to sirf nazar ki wajah se muqarrar ki gayi hai."
"1072","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazari ne humein khabar di, Humaid se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hujre ke shigaaf se jhaanka to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek tez dhaar wale teer se uska nishana liya to us shakhs ne apna sar bahar nikal liya."
"1073","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne mujh se bayan kiya, Khalid bin Yazid se, Saeed bin Abi Hilal se, Marwan bin Uthman se, ke Ubaid bin Umair ne unhein khabar di, Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Umar se ijazat maangi to mujhe teen martaba ijazat na mili to main wapas palat gaya to unhon ne meri taraf qasid bheja phir kaha: Ae Abdullah, kya mere darwaze par roke jana tum par bhaari guzra, jaan lo ke logon par bhi isi tarah bhaari guzarta hai ke tumhare darwaze par roke jayein, to maine kaha: Balke maine aap se teen martaba ijazat maangi phir mujhe ijazat na mili to main laut gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Tum ne ye kis se suna hai, to maine kaha: Maine ye Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suna hai, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se wo suna jo hum ne na suna, agar tum is par mere paas koi daleel na laye to main tumhein ibrat bana dunga, phir main nikla yahan tak ke Ansar ki ek jamaat ke paas aaya jo masjid mein baithe thay phir maine un se poocha to unhon ne kaha: Kya is mein koi shak karta hai, phir maine unhein bataya jo Umar ne kaha tha to unhon ne kaha: Tumhare saath sirf hum mein se sab se chhota khara hoga, phir Abu Saeed Khudri ya Abu Masood mere saath Umar tak khare hue, phir unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath nikle aur Aap Saad bin Ubada ka irada rakhte thay yahan tak ke Aap unke paas aaye phir salam kiya to Aap ko ijazat na mili, phir doosri martaba salam kiya, phir teesri martaba, phir Aap ko ijazat na mili, to Aap ne farmaya: Hum ne jo hum par tha wo ada kar diya, phir Aap wapas hue to Saad ne Aap ko pa liya phir kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke saath bheja, Aap ne koi martaba aisa salam nahin kiya magar main sunta raha aur aap ko jawab deta raha lekin maine chaha ke Aap mujh par aur mere ghar walon par kasrat se salam karein, to Abu Musa ne kaha: Allah ki qasam beshak main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki hadees par albatta ameen tha, to Umar ne kaha: Haan lekin maine chaha ke tehqeeq kar lun."
"1074","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abul Ahwas se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab aadmi ko bulaya jaye to use ijazat mil gayi."
"1075","Ayyash bin Waleed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Abu Rafi se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko bulaya jaye phir wo qasid ke saath aaye to yehi uski ijazat hai."
"1076","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib aur Hisham se, Muhammad se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi ka aadmi ki taraf qasid hi uski ijazat hai."
"1077","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abul Alaniya se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Saeed Khudri ke paas aaya phir maine salam kiya to mujhe ijazat na mili, phir maine salam kiya to mujhe ijazat na mili, phir maine teesri martaba salam kiya phir maine apni awaz buland ki aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum ae ghar walon, phir mujhe ijazat na mili, phir main ek taraf hat kar baith gaya, phir meri taraf ek ladka nikla phir us ne kaha: Dakhil ho jao, phir main dakhil hua, phir Abu Saeed ne mujh se kaha: Suno beshak agar tum zyada karte to tumhein ijazat na milti, phir maine un se bartanon ke bare mein poocha, phir maine un se kisi cheez ke bare mein na poocha magar unhon ne kaha: Haram hai, yahan tak ke maine un se jaf ke bare mein poocha to unhon ne kaha: Haram hai. Phir Muhammad ne kaha: Uske munh par chamra lagaya jata hai phir use bandha jata hai."
"1078","Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman al-Yahsibi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Busr ne mujh se bayan kiya, jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabi thay, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab kisi darwaze par aate aur ijazat chahte to uske samne na khare hote, dayein ya bayein se aate, phir agar Aap ko ijazat milti warna laut jate."
"1079","Hamen Abdullah bin Saleh ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Shuraij Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya, ke unhon ne Wahib bin Abdullah al-Maafiri ko kehte hue suna: mujhe Abdur Rahman bin Muawiya bin Hudaij ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: main Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab raziyallahu anhu ke pas hazir hua to maine un se andar ane ki ijazat mangi, to logon ne mujh se kaha: apni jagah thahro yahan tak ke woh tumhari taraf niklen, to main un ke darwaze ke qareeb baith gaya, unhon ne kaha: phir woh meri taraf nikle to unhon ne pani mangwaya aur wuzu kiya, phir unhon ne apne mozon par masah kiya, to maine kaha: aye Amirul Momineen, kya ye peshab ki wajah se hai, unhon ne kaha: peshab ki wajah se ya us ke siwa kisi aur cheez ki wajah se."
"1080","Hamen Malik bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Muttalib bin Ziyad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abu Bakr bin Abdullah al-Asbahani ne bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Malik bin al-Muntasir se, Hazrat Anas bin Malik se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke darwazon ko nakhunon se khatkhataya jata tha."
"1081","Hamen Abu Asim ne bayan kiya, aur Abu Hafs bin Ali ne un se kuch hissa mujhe samjhaya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Amr bin Abi Sufyan ne khabar di, ke Amr bin Abdullah bin Safwan ne unhen khabar di, ke Kaladah bin Hanbal ne unhen khabar di, ke Safwan bin Umayya ne unhen Fatah ke mauqe par Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf doodh aur bakri ke bache aur hari tarkari ke sath bheja, Abu Asim ne kaha: yani saag, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam wadi ke upari hisse me the, aur maine na salam kiya aur na ijazat mangi, to Aap ne farmaya: wapas jao phir kaho: Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil ho jaun, aur ye us ke baad tha jab Safwan Islam le aye the."
"1082","Hamen Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan bin Hamza ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Kaseer bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, Waleed bin Rabah se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jab nazar andar dakhil ho jaye to us ke liye ijazat nahi."
"1083","Hamen Muhammad bin Salam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Makhlad bin Yazid ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamen Ibn Juraij ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ata ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Hazrat Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: jab koi kahe: kya main dakhil ho jaun, aur salam na kare, to kaho: nahi, yahan tak ke tum chabi lekar aao, maine kaha: salam, unhon ne kaha: haan."
"1084","Unhon ne kaha: aur hamen Jarir ne khabar di, Mansur se, Ribi bin Hirash se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Banu Amir ke ek shakhs ne bayan kiya jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aya to us ne kaha: kya main ghus aaun, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne londi se farmaya: bahar jao aur us se kaho: kaho: Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil ho jaun, kyunke us ne ijazat mangna theek tarah nahi jana, unhon ne kaha: to maine us ki baat sun li is se pehle ke londi mere pas bahar aye to maine kaha: Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil ho jaun, to Aap ne farmaya: aur tum par salam, andar aao, unhon ne kaha: to main andar dakhil hua aur maine kaha: aap kis cheez ke sath aye hain, to Aap ne farmaya: main tumhare pas khair ke siwa kisi cheez ke sath nahi aya, main tumhare pas is liye aya hun ke tum Allah wahdah ki ibadat karo jis ka koi shareek nahi, aur Lat aur Uzza ki ibadat chhor do, aur raat din me paanch namazen parho, aur saal me ek mahina roza rakho, aur is ghar ka hajj karo, aur apne maldaron ke maal me se lekar use apne faqiron par lauta do, unhon ne kaha: to maine un se kaha: kya ilm me se koi cheez hai jo aap nahi jante, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ne khair sikhayi hai, aur ilm me se kuch woh hai jise Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta, paanch cheezen hain jinhen Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta: beshak Allah hi ke pas qayamat ka ilm hai, aur wahi barish nazil karta hai, aur wahi janta hai jo rahmon me hai, aur koi jaan nahi janti ke woh kal kya kamayegi, aur koi jaan nahi janti ke woh kis zameen me maregi."
"1085","Hamen Abdullah bin Abi Shaiba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yahya bin Adam ne bayan kiya, Hasan bin Saleh se, Salama bin Kuhail se, Saeed bin Jubair se, Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Umar ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ijazat mangi to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu ala Rasoolillah, Assalamu alaikum, kya Umar andar dakhil ho sakte hain."
"1086","Hamen Abul Waleed ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Shuba ne bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: maine Hazrat Jabir ko kehte hue suna: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas apne walid par jo qarz tha us ke silsile me aya, to maine darwaza khatkhataya, to Aap ne farmaya: kaun hai, to maine kaha: main, to Aap ne farmaya: main main, goya Aap ne ise napasand farmaya."
"1087","Hamen Ali bin al-Hasan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen al-Husain ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Abdullah bin Buraida ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam masjid ki taraf nikle aur Abu Musa qirat kar rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: ye kaun hai, to maine kaha: main Buraida hun, aap par qurban jaun, to Aap ne farmaya: ise Aal e Dawood ke mizmaron me se ek mizmar ata kiya gaya hai."
"1088","Hamen Malik bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Israil ne bayan kiya, Abu Jafar al-Farra se, Abdur Rahman bin Judan se, unhon ne kaha: main Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar ke sath tha, to unhon ne ek ghar walon se ijazat mangi, to kaha gaya: salam ke sath dakhil ho jao, to unhon ne un ke han dakhil hone se inkar kar diya."
"1089","Hamen Ayyub bin Sulaiman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Bakr bin Abi Uwais ne bayan kiya, Sulaiman se, Kaseer bin Zaid se, Waleed bin Rabah se, ke Hazrat Abu Huraira ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jab nazar dakhil ho jaye to ijazat nahi."
"1090","Hamen Muhammad bin Kaseer ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, Muslim bin Nazir se, unhon ne kaha: ek shakhs ne Hazrat Huzaifa se ijazat mangi to us ne jhank kar dekha aur kaha: kya dakhil ho jaun, to Huzaifa ne kaha: rahi tumhari aankh to woh to dakhil ho chuki, aur raha tumhara peechhla hissa to woh dakhil nahi hua."
"1091","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Aban bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Yahya ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Ishaq bin Abdullah ne un se bayan kiya Hazrat Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke ek dehati Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ghar aaya pas us ne apni aankh darwaze ke surakh par laga di pas Aap ne ek teer ya nokdar lakdi li pas us dehati ka qasd kiya taake us dehati ki aankh phod dein pas woh chala gaya pas Aap ne farmaya sun lo beshak agar tum thehre rehte to main tumhari aankh zaroor phod deta"
"1092","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Shoba ne hum se bayan kiya Ata bin Dinar se woh Ammar bin Sad at Tujeebi se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha Hazrat Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya jo shakhs ijazat milne se pehle kisi ghar ke sehan mein apni dono aankhen bhar kar dekhe pas us ne fisq ka irtikab kiya"
"1093","Ishaq bin al Ala ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Amr bin al Haris ne mujh se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdullah bin Salim ne mujh se bayan kiya Muhammad bin al Walid se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha Yazid bin Shurai ne hum se bayan kiya ke Abu Hayy al Muazzin ne un se bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke azaad karda ghulam Sauban ne un se bayan kiya ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya kisi musalman shakhs ke liye halal nahi ke woh ijazat lene se pehle ghar ke andar jhanke pas agar us ne aisa kiya to goya woh dakhil ho gaya aur woh kisi qaum ki imamat na kare phir un ko chhor kar dua mein apne aap ko khaas kare yahan tak ke woh laut jaye aur woh is haal mein namaz na parhe ke usay peshab pakhana roke hue ho yahan tak ke woh halka ho jaye"
"1094","Hisham bin Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Sadaqa bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abu Hafs Usman bin Abi al Atika ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Sulaiman bin Habib al Muharibi ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Abu Umama ko kehte suna unhon ne kaha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya teen shakhs hain un sab ka Allah par zimma hai agar zinda raha to us ki kifayat ki jayegi aur agar mar gaya to jannat mein dakhil hoga jo shakhs apne ghar mein salam ke sath dakhil hua pas woh Allah azza wa jalla ke zimme mein hai aur jo shakhs masjid ki taraf nikla pas woh Allah ke zimme mein hai aur jo shakhs Allah ke raste mein nikla pas woh Allah ke zimme mein hai"
"1095","Muhammad bin Muqatil ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdullah ne humein khabar di unhon ne kaha Ibn Juraij ne humein khabar di unhon ne kaha Abu Zubair ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Hazrat Jabir ko kehte suna jab tum apne ghar walon ke paas dakhil ho to un par salam kaho Allah ki taraf se tahiyyat ke taur par jo mubarak paakiza hai"
"1096","Khalifa ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ibn Juraij ne hum se bayan kiya Abu Zubair se woh Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna jab aadmi apne ghar mein dakhil ho pas apne dakhil hote waqt aur apne khane ke waqt Allah azza wa jalla ka zikr kare to shaitan kehta hai tumhare liye na raat guzarne ki jagah hai aur na raat ka khana aur jab woh dakhil ho pas apne dakhil hote waqt Allah ka zikr na kare to shaitan kehta hai tum ne raat guzarne ki jagah pa li aur agar apne khane ke waqt Allah ka zikr na kare to shaitan kehta hai tum ne raat guzarne ki jagah aur raat ka khana dono pa liye"
"1097","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ayan al Khuwarizmi ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha hum Hazrat Anas bin Malik ke paas aaye is haal mein ke woh apne dehleez mein baithe hue thay aur un ke sath koi na tha pas mere sathi ne un par salam kiya aur kaha kya main dakhil ho jaun pas Anas ne kaha dakhil ho jao yeh aisi jagah hai jahan koi ijazat talab nahi karta pas unhon ne hamare qareeb khana kiya pas hum ne khaya phir woh meethi nabeez ka bara pyala laye pas unhon ne piya aur humein pilaya"
"1098","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya Ibn Aun se woh Mujahid se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha Ibn Umar bazaar ki dukano par ijazat talab nahi karte thay"
"1099","Abu Hafs bin Ali ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Dahhak bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya Ibn Juraij se woh Ata se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha Ibn Umar kapra bechne wale ke saiban mein ijazat talab karte thay"
"1100","Abdur Rahman bin al Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ali bin al Ala al Khuzaee ne hum se bayan kiya Abu Abdul Malik se jo Asim bin Umar bin Khattab ki beti Umm Miskeen ke azaad karda ghulam hain unhon ne kaha meri malika ne mujhe Abu Huraira ke paas bheja pas woh mere sath aaye pas jab woh darwaze par khare hue to unhon ne kaha andar aaun unhon ne kaha andar aa jao pas unhon ne kaha ai Abu Huraira mere paas isha ke baad milne wale aate hain to kya main baat cheet karun unhon ne kaha jab tak tum witr na parh lo baat cheet karo pas jab tum witr parh lo to witr ke baad koi guftagu nahi"
"1101","Yahya bin Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Hakam bin al Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abbad yani Ibn Abbad ne hum se bayan kiya Asim al Ahwal se woh Abu Usman an Nahdi se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha Abu Musa ne Rahban ki taraf khat likha apne khat mein us par salam bhejte hue pas un se kaha gaya kya tum us par salam bhejte ho halanke woh kafir hai unhon ne kaha us ne mujhe khat likha pas mujh par salam bheja to main ne usay jawab diya"
"1102","Ahmad bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Muhammad bin Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya Yazid bin Abi Habib se woh Marsad se woh Abu Basra al Ghifari se woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya main kal yahud ki taraf sawar ho kar jane wala hun pas tum unhein salam karne mein pehel na karo pas jab woh tumhein salam karein to kaho wa alaikum"
"1103","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Ahl-e-Kitab ko salam me pehal na karo aur unhein raste ke sab se tang hisse ki taraf majboor karo."
"1104","Sadaqa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hafs bin Ghiyas ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Asim se, unhon ne Hammad se, unhon ne Ibrahim se, unhon ne Alqama se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abdullah ne Dahaqin ko sirf ishare se salam kiya."
"1105","Amr bin Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatada ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek Yahudi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas se guzra to us ne kaha: Assamu alaikum, to Aap ke sahaba ne salam ka jawab de diya, to Aap ne farmaya: Us ne kaha: Assamu alaikum, pas Yahudi pakda gaya to us ne iqrar kar liya, Aap ne farmaya: Us par wohi lauta do jo us ne kaha."
